              <p>Yes! All students get access to our cloud-based GPU clusters with NVIDIA A100 and V100 GPUs. You'll receive monthly computing credits sufficient for all course projects. We also teach you how to use Google Colab, AWS, and other cloud platforms for your future projects.</p>
